{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:76069b325b3c9127","name":"Flash Suppressor/Silencer","source":{"id":"source:reference-76069b325b3c9127","title":"Flash Suppressor/Silencer","revision":21180,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:18:35Z","sha256":"228714e82a5dac42abb367b25add1d45f6bc35375ef022ee0f5102a7dae64c95","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21180","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Flash%20Suppressor/Silencer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-76069b325b3c9127","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy of Intrigue"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 400\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Merr-Sonn Nonsonic is a typical example of a Flash Suppressor/Silencer. Fitting over the muzzle of any Small or larger slugthrower, this device reduces both the sound and the muzzle flash when the weapon is fired. A Flash Suppressor/Silencer imposes a -10 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks to discern the sound or spot the flash of an equipped slugthrower. It reduces the maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," of the weapon by two range increments.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
